    response: "# PRIVACY GATEWAY \342\200\224 PHASE 1 REPOSITORY STRUCTURE & MIGRATION PLAN\n\n---\n\n## 1. Existing File Inventory & Target Destination Plan\n\nThe table below maps every existing file in the repository to its exact destination in the proposed Phase 1 monorepo:\n\n| Existing File Path | Target Destination | Migration Action & Rationale |\n| :--- | :--- | :--- |\n| `/src/App.tsx` | `/apps/web/src/App.tsx` | Moved into the web frontend package (`apps/web`) to preserve all existing UI. |\n| `/src/main.tsx` | `/apps/web/src/main.tsx` | Moved into the web frontend package entry point. |\n| `/src/index.css` | `/apps/web/src/index.css` | Moved into the web frontend package styling. |\n| `/index.html` | `/apps/web/index.html` | Moved into the web frontend root (configured for Vite). |\n| `/vite.config.ts` | `/apps/web/vite.config.ts` | Moved into the web frontend package; updated path aliases if needed. |\n| `/package.json` | `/package.json` (Root) + `/apps/web/package.json` + `/apps/api/package.json` | Root `package.json` converted to an npm workspaces manifest orchestrating `apps/*` and `packages/*`; web dependencies extracted to `apps/web/package.json`. |\n| `/tsconfig.json` | `/tsconfig.base.json` + `/apps/web/tsconfig.json` | Root converted to shared base compiler configuration extended by `apps/web` and `apps/api`. |\n| `/.env.example` | `/.env.example` + `/apps/api/.env.example` | Root environment template documenting root Docker variables, database URLs, Redis URLs, and API ports. |\n| `/.gitignore` | `/.gitignore` | Preserved and updated to ignore monorepo build outputs (`dist/`, `node_modules/`, `coverage/`, `.env.local`). |\n| `/metadata.json` | `/metadata.json` | Preserved at workspace root for platform metadata. |\n| `/assets/.aistudio/.gitignore`| `/assets/.aistudio/.gitignore` | Preserved at workspace root. |\n\n---\n\n## 2. Proposed Phase 1 Monorepo Structure\n\n```\nprivacy-gateway/\n\342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 .env.example                       # Root template for Docker Compose & DB credentials\n\342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 .gitignore                         # Ignore build outputs, secrets, modules\n\342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 docker-compose.yml                 # Local multi-container development environment\n\342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 metadata.json                      # Workspace metadata\n\342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 package.json                       # Root workspace orchestrator (npm workspaces)\n\342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 README.md                          # Phase 1 setup, architecture, and verification instructions\n\342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 tsconfig.base.json                 # Shared TypeScript configuration\n\342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 apps/\n\342\224\202   \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 api/                           # Backend REST & health service\n\342\224\202   \342\224\202   \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 .env.example               # Backend service environment template\n\342\224\202   \342\224\202   \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 package.json               # Backend dependencies (Express, pg, redis, zod, etc.)\n\342\224\202   \342\224\202   \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 tsconfig.json              # Backend TypeScript config extending tsconfig.base.json\n\342\224\202   \342\224\202   \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 src/\n\342\224\202   \342\224\202   \342\224\202   \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 config/\n\342\224\202   \342\224\202   \342\224\202   \342\224\202   \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 database.ts        # PostgreSQL connection pool (pg.Pool) with retry logic\n\342\224\202   \342\224\202   \342\224\202   \342\224\202   \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 redis.ts           # Redis client with retry & health verification\n\342\224\202   \342\224\202   \342\224\202   \342\224\202   \342\224\224\342\224\200\342\224\200 env.ts             # Zod-validated environment schema\n\342\224\202   \342\224\202   \342\224\202   \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 controllers/\n\342\224\202   \342\224\202   \342\224\202   \342\224\202   \342\224\224\342\224\200\342\224\200 health.controller.ts # Health check controller (DB ping, Redis ping, system stats)\n\342\224\202   \342\224\202   \342\224\202   \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 middleware/\n\342\224\202   \342\224\202   \342\224\202   \342\224\202   \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 error.middleware.ts  # Centralized error handler\n\342\224\202   \342\224\202   \342\224\202   \342\224\202   \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 logging.middleware.ts# Structured JSON request logger (zero PII)\n\342\224\202   \342\224\202   \342\224\202   \342\224\202   \342\224\224\342\224\200\342\224\200 security.middleware.ts # Helmet headers, CORS policy, rate-limiter\n\342\224\202   \342\224\202   \342\224\202   \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 routes/\n\342\224\202   \342\224\202   \342\224\202   \342\224\202   \342\224\224\342\224\200\342\224\200 health.routes.ts   # GET /health, GET /health/live, GET /health/ready\n\342\224\202   \342\224\202   \342\224\202   \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 app.ts                 # Express application definition\n\342\224\202   \342\224\202   \342\224\202   \342\224\224\342\224\200\342\224\200 server.ts              # Server bootstrap and graceful shutdown handler\n\342\224\202   \342\224\202   \342\224\224\342\224\200\342\224\200 tests/\n\342\224\202   \342\224\202       \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 health.test.ts         # Basic automated integration tests for health endpoints\n\342\224\202   \342\224\202       \342\224\224\342\224\200\342\224\200 env.test.ts            # Environment validation tests\n\342\224\202   \342\224\224\342\224\200\342\224\200 web/                           # Preserved React + Vite Web Dashboard\n\342\224\202       \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 index.html                 # Preserved Vite HTML template\n\342\224\202       \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 package.json               # Frontend dependencies (React 19, Tailwind, Lucide, Motion)\n\342\224\202       \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 tsconfig.json              # Frontend TypeScript config extending tsconfig.base.json\n\342\224\202       \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 vite.config.ts             # Preserved Vite configuration\n\342\224\202       \342\224\224\342\224\200\342\224\200 src/\n\342\224\202           \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 App.tsx                # Preserved App component\n\342\224\202           \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 index.css              # Preserved CSS entry point\n\342\224\202           \342\224\224\342\224\200\342\224\200 main.tsx               # Preserved React DOM entry point\n\342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 docker/\n\342\224\202   \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 api/\n\342\224\202   \342\224\202   \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 Dockerfile                 # Multi-stage, non-root (UID 10001) Node.js build\n\342\224\202   \342\224\202   \342\224\224\342\224\200\342\224\200 .dockerignore              # Ignore node_modules and local artifacts\n\342\224\202   \342\224\224\342\224\200\342\224\200 postgres/\n\342\224\202       \342\224\224\342\224\200\342\224\200 init-db.sh                 # Database initialization script for extensions\n\342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 infrastructure/\n\342\224\202   \342\224\224\342\224\200\342\224\200 migrations/                    # SQL Database Migration System\n\342\224\202       \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 001_initial_schema.sql     # PostgreSQL DDL from approved Phase 0.1 schema\n\342\224\202       \342\224\224\342\224\200\342\224\200 runner.ts                  # Lightweight, transactional migration execution script\n\342\224\224\342\224\200\342\224\200 packages/\n    \342\224\224\342\224\200\342\224\200 shared-types/                  # Shared TypeScript interfaces & DTOs\n        \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 package.json\n        \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 tsconfig.json\n        \342\224\224\342\224\200\342\224\200 src/\n            \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 api.ts                 # Health, response envelopes, error DTOs\n            \342\224\224\342\224\200\342\224\200 index.ts\n```\n\n---\n\n## 3. Scope of Phase 1 Implementation\n\n### What Will Be Implemented in Phase 1:\n1. **Monorepo Foundation**: Standard npm workspaces linking `apps/web`, `apps/api`, and `packages/shared-types`.\n2. **Web Frontend Reorganization**: Safely moving the existing React/Tailwind frontend into `apps/web` without data loss or broken imports.\n3. **Backend Service (`apps/api`)**:\n   - Express TypeScript service with strict Zod environment variable parsing (`env.ts`).\n   - Secure middleware stack: Helmet security headers, CORS protection, structured JSON request logging.\n   - Live & Readiness Probes (`/health/live`, `/health/ready`) verifying actual PostgreSQL and Redis connectivity.\n   - Graceful shutdown lifecycle management (handling `SIGTERM`/`SIGINT` by draining active connections).\n4. **PostgreSQL 16 Database with Migration Engine**:\n   - Transactional migration runner executing against the approved Phase 0.1 schema (`001_initial_schema.sql`).\n   - Tables created: `users`, `authentication_accounts`, `user_sessions`, `devices`, `vpn_servers`, `wireguard_peers`, `subscriptions`, `privacy_scans`, `privacy_events`, `audit_logs`.\n   - Extensions: `uuid-ossp`, `pgcrypto`.\n5. **Redis 7 In-Memory Service**:\n   - Configured strictly for the real-time event bus, rate limiting, and queueing required by the architecture.\n6. **Docker Compose Environment**:\n   - Services: `postgres` (16.2-alpine), `redis` (7.2-alpine), `api` (non-root Node 22).\n   - Security constraints: `no-new-privileges:true`, dropped capabilities (`cap_drop: ALL`), non-root users (`10001:10001` for API, `999:999` for Redis, `postgres` for DB), `read_only` root filesystems where applicable, isolated internal bridge network (`pg-internal-net`).\n7. **Automated Test Suite**:\n   - Basic automated tests verifying environment parsing and API health checks.\n8. **README Documentation**:\n   - Step-by-step instructions for running locally with Docker Compose, running database migrations, running tests, and starting development services.\n\n### What is Explicitly DEFERRED to Later Phases (NOT in Phase 1):\n- \342\235\214 Google OAuth / OIDC PKCE authentication logic (Phase 2)\n- \342\235\214 WireGuard server netlink daemon & kernel peer control (Phase 3)\n- \342\235\214 Tauri desktop client (Phase 5)\n- \342\235\214 Browser extension (Phase 6)\n- \342\235\214 Privacy scoring computation & tracker classification (Phase 7)\n- \342\235\214 Synthetic DNS/WebRTC leak probers (Phase 7)\n- \342\235\214 Multi-region production infrastructure & billing integration (Phases 12+)\n\n---\n\n## 4. Migration Plan & Sequence\n\nWhen approved, execution will follow these surgical steps:\n1. **Create Directory Structure**: Create `apps/web`, `apps/api`, `packages/shared-types`, `infrastructure/migrations`, and `docker/`.\n2. **Move Frontend Files**: Relocate `src/App.tsx`, `src/main.tsx`, `src/index.css`, `index.html`, and `vite.config.ts` into `apps/web/`.\n3. **Configure Monorepo Root**: Configure root `package.json`, root `tsconfig.base.json`, and `.env.example`.\n4. **Build `packages/shared-types`**: Establish the shared contracts module.\n5. **Build `apps/api`**: Scaffold Express server, PostgreSQL connection pool, Redis client, health routes, and test suite.\n6. **Create Migration System**: Add `infrastructure/migrations/001_initial_schema.sql` and the TypeScript migration runner.\n7. **Create Docker Files**: Add `docker-compose.yml` and `docker/api/Dockerfile`.\n8. **Add README.md**: Provide exact local setup and verification commands.\n9. **Verify Build & Compilation**: Ensure all workspaces compile cleanly with zero TypeScript errors.\n\n---\n\n### Request for Approval\n\nPlease review this proposed repository structure and migration plan. Once you give your approval, I will proceed with executing Phase 1."
    modified_response: "# PRIVACY GATEWAY \342\200\224 PHASE 1 REPOSITORY STRUCTURE & MIGRATION PLAN\n\n---\n\n## 1. Existing File Inventory & Target Destination Plan\n\nThe table below maps every existing file in the repository to its exact destination in the proposed Phase 1 monorepo:\n\n| Existing File Path | Target Destination | Migration Action & Rationale |\n| :--- | :--- | :--- |\n| `/src/App.tsx` | `/apps/web/src/App.tsx` | Moved into the web frontend package (`apps/web`) to preserve all existing UI. |\n| `/src/main.tsx` | `/apps/web/src/main.tsx` | Moved into the web frontend package entry point. |\n| `/src/index.css` | `/apps/web/src/index.css` | Moved into the web frontend package styling. |\n| `/index.html` | `/apps/web/index.html` | Moved into the web frontend root (configured for Vite). |\n| `/vite.config.ts` | `/apps/web/vite.config.ts` | Moved into the web frontend package; updated path aliases if needed. |\n| `/package.json` | `/package.json` (Root) + `/apps/web/package.json` + `/apps/api/package.json` | Root `package.json` converted to an npm workspaces manifest orchestrating `apps/*` and `packages/*`; web dependencies extracted to `apps/web/package.json`. |\n| `/tsconfig.json` | `/tsconfig.base.json` + `/apps/web/tsconfig.json` | Root converted to shared base compiler configuration extended by `apps/web` and `apps/api`. |\n| `/.env.example` | `/.env.example` + `/apps/api/.env.example` | Root environment template documenting root Docker variables, database URLs, Redis URLs, and API ports. |\n| `/.gitignore` | `/.gitignore` | Preserved and updated to ignore monorepo build outputs (`dist/`, `node_modules/`, `coverage/`, `.env.local`). |\n| `/metadata.json` | `/metadata.json` | Preserved at workspace root for platform metadata. |\n| `/assets/.aistudio/.gitignore`| `/assets/.aistudio/.gitignore` | Preserved at workspace root. |\n\n---\n\n## 2. Proposed Phase 1 Monorepo Structure\n\n```\nprivacy-gateway/\n\342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 .env.example                       # Root template for Docker Compose & DB credentials\n\342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 .gitignore                         # Ignore build outputs, secrets, modules\n\342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 docker-compose.yml                 # Local multi-container development environment\n\342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 metadata.json                      # Workspace metadata\n\342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 package.json                       # Root workspace orchestrator (npm workspaces)\n\342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 README.md                          # Phase 1 setup, architecture, and verification instructions\n\342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 tsconfig.base.json                 # Shared TypeScript configuration\n\342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 apps/\n\342\224\202   \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 api/                           # Backend REST & health service\n\342\224\202   \342\224\202   \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 .env.example               # Backend service environment template\n\342\224\202   \342\224\202   \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 package.json               # Backend dependencies (Express, pg, redis, zod, etc.)\n\342\224\202   \342\224\202   \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 tsconfig.json              # Backend TypeScript config extending tsconfig.base.json\n\342\224\202   \342\224\202   \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 src/\n\342\224\202   \342\224\202   \342\224\202   \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 config/\n\342\224\202   \342\224\202   \342\224\202   \342\224\202   \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 database.ts        # PostgreSQL connection pool (pg.Pool) with retry logic\n\342\224\202   \342\224\202   \342\224\202   \342\224\202   \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 redis.ts           # Redis client with retry & health verification\n\342\224\202   \342\224\202   \342\224\202   \342\224\202   \342\224\224\342\224\200\342\224\200 env.ts             # Zod-validated environment schema\n\342\224\202   \342\224\202   \342\224\202   \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 controllers/\n\342\224\202   \342\224\202   \342\224\202   \342\224\202   \342\224\224\342\224\200\342\224\200 health.controller.ts # Health check controller (DB ping, Redis ping, system stats)\n\342\224\202   \342\224\202   \342\224\202   \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 middleware/\n\342\224\202   \342\224\202   \342\224\202   \342\224\202   \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 error.middleware.ts  # Centralized error handler\n\342\224\202   \342\224\202   \342\224\202   \342\224\202   \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 logging.middleware.ts# Structured JSON request logger (zero PII)\n\342\224\202   \342\224\202   \342\224\202   \342\224\202   \342\224\224\342\224\200\342\224\200 security.middleware.ts # Helmet headers, CORS policy, rate-limiter\n\342\224\202   \342\224\202   \342\224\202   \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 routes/\n\342\224\202   \342\224\202   \342\224\202   \342\224\202   \342\224\224\342\224\200\342\224\200 health.routes.ts   # GET /health, GET /health/live, GET /health/ready\n\342\224\202   \342\224\202   \342\224\202   \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 app.ts                 # Express application definition\n\342\224\202   \342\224\202   \342\224\202   \342\224\224\342\224\200\342\224\200 server.ts              # Server bootstrap and graceful shutdown handler\n\342\224\202   \342\224\202   \342\224\224\342\224\200\342\224\200 tests/\n\342\224\202   \342\224\202       \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 health.test.ts         # Basic automated integration tests for health endpoints\n\342\224\202   \342\224\202       \342\224\224\342\224\200\342\224\200 env.test.ts            # Environment validation tests\n\342\224\202   \342\224\224\342\224\200\342\224\200 web/                           # Preserved React + Vite Web Dashboard\n\342\224\202       \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 index.html                 # Preserved Vite HTML template\n\342\224\202       \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 package.json               # Frontend dependencies (React 19, Tailwind, Lucide, Motion)\n\342\224\202       \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 tsconfig.json              # Frontend TypeScript config extending tsconfig.base.json\n\342\224\202       \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 vite.config.ts             # Preserved Vite configuration\n\342\224\202       \342\224\224\342\224\200\342\224\200 src/\n\342\224\202           \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 App.tsx                # Preserved App component\n\342\224\202           \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 index.css              # Preserved CSS entry point\n\342\224\202           \342\224\224\342\224\200\342\224\200 main.tsx               # Preserved React DOM entry point\n\342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 docker/\n\342\224\202   \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 api/\n\342\224\202   \342\224\202   \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 Dockerfile                 # Multi-stage, non-root (UID 10001) Node.js build\n\342\224\202   \342\224\202   \342\224\224\342\224\200\342\224\200 .dockerignore              # Ignore node_modules and local artifacts\n\342\224\202   \342\224\224\342\224\200\342\224\200 postgres/\n\342\224\202       \342\224\224\342\224\200\342\224\200 init-db.sh                 # Database initialization script for extensions\n\342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 infrastructure/\n\342\224\202   \342\224\224\342\224\200\342\224\200 migrations/                    # SQL Database Migration System\n\342\224\202       \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 001_initial_schema.sql     # PostgreSQL DDL from approved Phase 0.1 schema\n\342\224\202       \342\224\224\342\224\200\342\224\200 runner.ts                  # Lightweight, transactional migration execution script\n\342\224\224\342\224\200\342\224\200 packages/\n    \342\224\224\342\224\200\342\224\200 shared-types/                  # Shared TypeScript interfaces & DTOs\n        \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 package.json\n        \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 tsconfig.json\n        \342\224\224\342\224\200\342\224\200 src/\n            \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 api.ts                 # Health, response envelopes, error DTOs\n            \342\224\224\342\224\200\342\224\200 index.ts\n```\n\n---\n\n## 3. Scope of Phase 1 Implementation\n\n### What Will Be Implemented in Phase 1:\n1. **Monorepo Foundation**: Standard npm workspaces linking `apps/web`, `apps/api`, and `packages/shared-types`.\n2. **Web Frontend Reorganization**: Safely moving the existing React/Tailwind frontend into `apps/web` without data loss or broken imports.\n3. **Backend Service (`apps/api`)**:\n   - Express TypeScript service with strict Zod environment variable parsing (`env.ts`).\n   - Secure middleware stack: Helmet security headers, CORS protection, structured JSON request logging.\n   - Live & Readiness Probes (`/health/live`, `/health/ready`) verifying actual PostgreSQL and Redis connectivity.\n   - Graceful shutdown lifecycle management (handling `SIGTERM`/`SIGINT` by draining active connections).\n4. **PostgreSQL 16 Database with Migration Engine**:\n   - Transactional migration runner executing against the approved Phase 0.1 schema (`001_initial_schema.sql`).\n   - Tables created: `users`, `authentication_accounts`, `user_sessions`, `devices`, `vpn_servers`, `wireguard_peers`, `subscriptions`, `privacy_scans`, `privacy_events`, `audit_logs`.\n   - Extensions: `uuid-ossp`, `pgcrypto`.\n5. **Redis 7 In-Memory Service**:\n   - Configured strictly for the real-time event bus, rate limiting, and queueing required by the architecture.\n6. **Docker Compose Environment**:\n   - Services: `postgres` (16.2-alpine), `redis` (7.2-alpine), `api` (non-root Node 22).\n   - Security constraints: `no-new-privileges:true`, dropped capabilities (`cap_drop: ALL`), non-root users (`10001:10001` for API, `999:999` for Redis, `postgres` for DB), `read_only`