  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Examining Web App Structure**\n\nI\'m now diving into the `apps/web` structure to build the web dashboard UI. I\'ve started looking at `src/App.tsx` and `apps/web/src/App.tsx`, focusing on component creation within `apps/web`. The first component I\'m considering is `src/App.tsx` / `apps/web/src/App.tsx`.\n\n\n**Designing Dashboard Layout**\n\nI\'ve been working on the layout for a dark, high-contrast dashboard for Privacy Gateway Phase 1 operations. I\'m focusing on key areas: a Live Service Health Monitor displaying `/health` and `/api/v1/system/info` data with status badges, and a Database & Schema Migration Inspector presenting PostgreSQL table details from `001_initial_schema.sql`. I will also work on an Architecture & Security Enclaves Viewer.\n\n\n"
